// PARAM: --analysis interval
// C-style unified expressions make a comparison an ordinary int-valued exp
// (0 or 1), so it can itself be an operand of another comparison, not only
// the top-level condition of if/assume. LT and EQEQ are both `assoc: none`
// at the same precedence (grammar/vimp.yaml), so the outer comparison needs
// explicit parens: `(x < 0) == 1`. x is a concrete negative literal, so the
// inner comparison's value is exact and the outer one is decidable too --
// this exercises aval's nested-boolean-as-value path independently of the
// top-level branch/assume gate (branch_lifted's own case split, exercised
// separately by the 06-reachability fixtures).
void main() {
  int32 x;
  x := 0 - 1;
  __voblint_check((x < 0) == 1) // PROVED
}
